# Tuned coder image for the swarm (009). Build: make swarm-coder-image
# Base keeps Qwen3.5's tool-capable template/parser. Harness still sends
# think:false per call (extra_body) — required for tool_calls parsing.
FROM qwen3.5:9b

# Deterministic edits; context window for long agent loops (raise NUM_CTX if VRAM allows)
PARAMETER temperature 0
PARAMETER top_k 20
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER num_ctx 65536

# Coder discipline baked in: exact tool args, smallest diff, no chatter.
SYSTEM """You are a precise file-editing coding agent in an autonomous swarm.
Rules:
- Act through tools only. Call one tool per step with exact arguments.
- Read a file before editing it. Edit by exact-match replacement of a unique string.
- Make the smallest diff that satisfies the task. Never rewrite whole files.
- No network access, no speculative changes, no questions back: decide and act.
- When done, summarize files changed and how each satisfies the task."""
